{"3798230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Idol Party 2 - Love Vibe", "steam_appid": 3798230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idol Party Ⅱ</strong> is a rhythm adventure where open-world exploration, stylish dress-up, and lively social moments come together! Step into the spotlight, express your unique style, and share the beat with friends. Your journey to stardom starts here—join the party now! 💖</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/e3ee3ca241623ad85e07488940509a4e.poster.avif?t=1769132664\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/e3ee3ca241623ad85e07488940509a4e.webm?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/e3ee3ca241623ad85e07488940509a4e.mp4?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To thank all players for your support, we’ve prepared a special gift for every new idol! 🎁</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More exciting rewards are waiting for you both in-game and on our <strong>Discord server</strong>—don't miss out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CDK:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REI3J75S7F</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >XEWZ341G3M</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2GUJZ1V3FN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6XYN6METNI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/ce8eaa423caf032cfbf823442ad128e5.poster.avif?t=1769132664\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/ce8eaa423caf032cfbf823442ad128e5.webm?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/ce8eaa423caf032cfbf823442ad128e5.mp4?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【Rhythm &amp; Dance Gameplay】</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Groove to a massive music library packed with trending hits! Follow dynamic beats, master dazzling choreography, and show off your dance moves in thrilling rhythm battles. Feel the rush—own the stage! ✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/a19bfb3c44ae704c88ab4b2974b2dde1.poster.avif?t=1769132664\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/a19bfb3c44ae704c88ab4b2974b2dde1.webm?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/a19bfb3c44ae704c88ab4b2974b2dde1.mp4?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【Outfit Styling &amp; DIY: Your Wardrobe, Your Rules!】</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own fashion pieces with a wide range of fabrics, decals, accessories, and tools available in-game. From glamorous stage outfits to casual streetwear—your creativity has no limits. Design, mix, and shine!✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/6c1ff1f3ec69226fe492b738ae566097.poster.avif?t=1769132664\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/6c1ff1f3ec69226fe492b738ae566097.webm?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/6c1ff1f3ec69226fe492b738ae566097.mp4?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/c520d2dafdff1e4fead748ad47edf5f9.poster.avif?t=1769132664\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/c520d2dafdff1e4fead748ad47edf5f9.webm?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/c520d2dafdff1e4fead748ad47edf5f9.mp4?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【Open-World Treasure Hunt】</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of repetitive quests? Hop on unique mounts and soar across floating islands in a vibrant open world. Explore freely, discover hidden treasure chests, and interact with scattered curiosities and items—uncover fun surprises and unexpected adventures at every turn! ✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/0d9a07b39046ba5ab20c758fa1674094.poster.avif?t=1769132664\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/0d9a07b39046ba5ab20c758fa1674094.webm?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/0d9a07b39046ba5ab20c758fa1674094.mp4?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【Vibrant Social Interaction &amp; Heartfelt Bonds】</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing solo is cozy, but partying together is a blast! Along your journey, you can hang out with friends, chat with unique NPCs, and even meet someone special. Dance together, explore side by side, and unlock exclusive interactions and sweet rewards. Deepen your bond, hold a romantic ceremony under the stars, make your vows, and begin a journey that belongs only to the two of you. ✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/53457b92177f67e3b52c4afa2a09d84d.poster.avif?t=1769132664\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/53457b92177f67e3b52c4afa2a09d84d.webm?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/53457b92177f67e3b52c4afa2a09d84d.mp4?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【Powerful Avatar Creation &amp; Photo System】</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a look that's truly one-of-a-kind with our advanced character customization tools. Then capture every moment in style with our versatile photo mode—pose freely and snap stunning shots from every angle! ✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/3481a28b2b38f8fd5d8cd892ab28eb95.poster.avif?t=1769132664\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/3481a28b2b38f8fd5d8cd892ab28eb95.webm?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/3481a28b2b38f8fd5d8cd892ab28eb95.mp4?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/ce218e3eeedfbfdf5d9fb458a90015b4.poster.avif?t=1769132664\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/ce218e3eeedfbfdf5d9fb458a90015b4.webm?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/ce218e3eeedfbfdf5d9fb458a90015b4.mp4?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【Relaxing Fishing: An Angler's Paradise】</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling tired or just want to unwind? Cast your line by the tranquil lakeside and enjoy some peaceful downtime. You can even collect unique fish from every floating island! ✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/b80e56db02101f819627315abbe7f4ea.poster.avif?t=1769132664\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/b80e56db02101f819627315abbe7f4ea.webm?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/b80e56db02101f819627315abbe7f4ea.mp4?t=1769132664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idol Party Ⅱ</strong> is a rhythm adventure where open-world exploration, stylish dress-up, and lively social moments come together! Step into the spotlight, express your unique style, and share the beat with friends. Your journey to stardom starts here—join the party now! 💖</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"